WEBVTT

00:04:27.989 --> 00:04:30.379
But what do the Russians think?

00:04:33.343 --> 00:04:35.293
That looks significantly different.

00:04:35.881 --> 00:04:38.034
Who's right? Who's wrong?

00:04:38.058 --> 00:04:39.463
What should I believe?

00:04:39.487 --> 00:04:40.847
What could I trust?

00:04:40.871 --> 00:04:42.335
This is part of the issue.

00:04:43.864 --> 00:04:50.641
In the absence of this framework
to monitor space-actor behavior,

00:04:51.421 --> 00:04:53.694
to monitor activity in space --

00:04:53.718 --> 00:04:55.469
where these objects are located --

00:04:55.493 --> 00:04:58.430
to reconcile these inconsistencies

00:04:58.454 --> 00:05:00.910
and make this knowledge commonplace,